"rn1qkb1r/pb2pppp/2p2n2/1p2N3/2pP4/2N3P1/PP2PPBP/R1BQK2R b KQkq -":{"variation":"pure-slav","moves":[{"uci":"f6d5","book":true,"notes":[{"text":"Your knight hits the c3 knight, forcing White to trade or push it away with e4.","original":"If you ask me, Nd5 is the only not so passive move. It forces white to either exchange knight on d5 ( which is not good ) or to push the knight away with e4.\nWhile e4 is building up the center it closes the LSB for very long time and loses pressure over weak c6 pawn.\nSome people recommend here 7. .. Nbd7 . but I personally dont like it.","ideas":[{"type":"purpose","from":"d5","relation":"attacks","targets":["c3"]}]}]}]},
